{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Implementation complete and pushed for review as Gerrit change 3173 (commit 73e90b296e2, Change-Id I5368f3c4f5900a5b6c31715c77cb5b6c98f9c277).\n\nLocal evidence on the pre-merge tree:\n- make verify green: 20117 passed, 27 skipped, 41m07s, exit 0.\n- make lint exit 0 including zizmor, actionlint, and all three ratchets.\n- gen_env_registry.py --check clean; docs/env-vars.md now carries 172 REBAR_* rows.\n- git grep 'REBAR_CANARY_HEARTBEAT_SOURCE|github-api' -- scripts .github tests returns 0 hits.\n\nThree scope deviations are recorded in the commit message: the bootstrap keyword was removed rather than made required, changelog and release-note entries were added for the canary retirement, and the detect_config.py/architecture.md edits were dropped because the plan premise that justified them was false (detect_env_vars never calls render()).\n\nACs will be re-run against the landed tree before close."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793462154247651001,"uuid":"62f8870a-2749-468f-9b83-182008237bba"}